	quest.1229EB557E29278F.quest_desc: [
		"§eHow the boiler works:§r put fuel (coal, charcoal, coke) in the bottom slot and pipe water into it. It heats up slowly, then starts making steam. Pipe steam from the boiler into your steam machines with MI fluid pipes."
		""
		"Machines only take steam from their output-facing side, so use the wrench to set sides."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Bronze Boiler and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1229EB557E29278F.title: "Bronze Boiler"
